      "samerow": true,
      "lines": [
        "图 195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "的力$F_1$的作用点通过了较短的路程$s_1$. 量出这两段路程及",
        "这两个力的大小，结果就会发现，**作用在杠杆上的力的作用点**",
        "**所通过的路程与力的大小成反比：**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{s_1}{s_2}=\\frac{F_2}{F_1}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "可见，**将力作用到杠杆比较长的一臂上，可以达到省力的目**",
        "**的，不过省多少倍力的同时就要费多少倍的路程.**"
      ]
